USpicy CRESCENT USND-1801 18W LED Nail Polish Light / Lamp / Dryer (White) for Curing Gelish &amp; LED Gels w/ Full 1 Year Warranty, 2012 Brand New Model Upgraded with Digital Countdown Timer 30s-90s, SPA Equipment. USpicyTM-Fashion Meets TechnologyUSpicyTM was created by a very simple goal - to provide high quality health and beauty products at budget-friendly prices so that everyone can afford. Why "U&#x2022;Spicy"? Because we put the sole focus on YOU, and dedicate ourselves to creating your own unique style, which allows YOU to feel SPICY whenever & wherever.Features:- Environment protection: LED lights don't generate harmful substances to human body- Energy-saving: LED lights consume much less power- Safety: Does not produce heat, not harm your hands- Longevity: LED lights can last for 35000-50000 hours, much longer than other types of lights- Portability: LED lights are not easily broken- LED Nail dryer can last longer and cost a lot less of your money in the long term- New digital countdown timer conveniently tracks the remaining timeSpecifications:- Color: White- Rated voltage range: AC100-120V, 60HZ- Product size: 249 * 205 * 95 mm- Product weight: 1.02 kg- CE Certification- Rated power: 18W- Built-in Infrared sensor automatically turn on when putting hand into the dryer, and the light starts working- Auto Timer Control: 30s, 60s and 90s- Using life: > 35000 hours- Warranty: 1-Year Manufacturer Warranty- Solidification time:
Using LED modeling gel, the solidification time is < 10s;
Using LED base gel, the solidification time is < 20s;
Using LED top gel, the solidification time is < 40s;
Using LED method of three-in-one gel, the solidification time is < 20sPackage includes:- 1* USpicy CRESCENT 18W LED Lamp Nail Dryer (White)- 1 * Free Nail Sanding file Beauty Tools & Accessories Nail Dryers Nail Tools

